# Fixtures must be able to carry a committed .env: RFC-0001 calls for a fixture
# "with a committed .env", and detecting one is a named requirement (AGENTS.md §4).
# The values in them are synthetic. Without this negation the rule above silently
# excludes the file the detector exists to find. See SPIKE.md.
!fixtures/**/.env
